{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"pcb-trace-width-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"pcb-trace-width-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["pcb-trace-width-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Pumili ng isang lapad o kasalukuyang kapasidad ng pagtatantya, piliin ang isang panloob o panlabas na layer ng tanso, at ipasok ang kasalukuyang, timbang ng tanso at pagtaas ng temperatura. Ang kalkulador ay gumagamit ng klasikong IPC-ZXQPH0000QXZ empirical equation at ulat lapad sa mil at millimeters.","record_id":"d9c5c6627fdc7264f5bf7aa3e077a044b718d9803602922e20cd65f169f51cb9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.01793658937504,"source":"Choose a width or current-capacity estimate, select an internal or external copper layer, and enter current, copper weight and temperature rise. The calculator uses the classic IPC-2221 empirical equation and reports width in mil and millimetres.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"90bb27d1a10b7e9cf52922f769e260426ecb3a8ea6ddb75e8dcc2334856b1d3e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Pumili ng isang lapad o kasalukuyang kapasidad ng pagtatantya, piliin ang isang panloob o panlabas na layer ng tanso, at ipasok ang kasalukuyang, timbang ng tanso at pagtaas ng temperatura. Ang kalkulador ay gumagamit ng klasikong IPC-2221 empirical equation at ulat lapad sa mil at millimeters.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
